    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16198cc32ed5dce3833358da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白多伯眺望着远处的烟花。\r\n她对弟弟妹妹的关爱，让她脸上的笑容显得无比柔和。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9abcccb896d06fc98db63c72e56a8b2ac78aa1ddf8ca1b05eb75d59a7d3677a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
